FE_28042026203957_ECTranscriptSE28042026_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-04-28T20:41"}]},{"q":"FY27Q1","ql":"Q1 FY27","basis":"standalone","fin":true,"label":"—","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_LI_1700867_24072026045312_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-07-24T14:40:58","src":"NSE announcement","day":0.3,"w1":1.3,"m1":-5.2},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_24072026144041_SEBM24072026_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T14:40"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_24072026145845_SEPR24072026_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T14:58"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_24072026203935_AR24072026_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-07-24T20:39"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","ts":"2026-07-30T18:53"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"APE +36% to Rs 5,380 cr, VNB +29% to Rs 1,410 cr (margin dipped to 26.2%), PAT +22% to Rs 720 cr; 13m persistency up to 87.7%.","quote":"SBI Life Insurance — Q1 FY27 (results 24 Jul 2026) Very strong top-line: new-business growth accelerated sharply, though the VNB margin slipped on mix — a volume-led quarter. Growth KPIs. APE Rs 5,380 cr (+36% YoY) — the headline growth metric for a life insurer. New business premium Rs 8,910 cr (+23% YoY); private-market share 20.5%. Value creation. VNB Rs 1,410 cr (+29% YoY) , but VNB margin com","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Gross written premium grew 20% to INR 212.9 billion, and profit after tax increased 22% year-on-year to INR 7.2 billion.","quote":"Gross written premium stands at INR212.9 billion with a growth of 20%. The company's profit after tax for the quarter stood at INR7.2 billion, registering a strong growth of 22% over the corresponding quarter of previous year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Persistency for individual regular premiums improved by 61 basis points to 87.7% for the 13th month and by 68 basis points to 69.1% for the 49th month.","quote":"With respect to persistency of individual regular premiums, 13th and 49th month persistency stands at 87.7% and 69.1%, showing an improvement of 61 and 68 basis points, respectively.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The operating expense ratio and total cost ratio increased to 7.7% and 12%, respectively, from 6.3% and 10.8% in the previous year's quarter.","quote":"Coming to operational efficiency, opex ratio stands at 7.7% and total cost ratio stands at 12% for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, as compared to 6.3% and 10.8%, respectively, for the corresponding period ended June 30, 2025.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"A higher proportion of group business in the first quarter reduced the company's overall margin compared to the previous year.","quote":"That has affected margin overall, and it has brought down as compared to last year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects the agency distribution channel to deliver an even stronger contribution over the remaining three quarters.","quote":"We are sure that the agency in the remaining 3 quarters will also be contributing even a stronger number.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Credit protect business was flat year-on-year but in line with projections, with management expecting a good uptick in future quarters.","quote":"So the credit protect, which you asked, Neeraj, it is flat as compared to the last year. And -- but it is going as per the planned number. So we will see some good uptick in the coming quarters.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"SBI Life projects Individual Rated Premium growth of 14% to 15% for the year.","quote":"And our growth projections for the year on IRP basis remains at 14%, 15%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company guided for a full-year value of new business margin between 26% and 28%.","quote":"The margin guidance was 26% to 28%, and we are within the range, although at the lower end of that.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Growth in sum assured reflects strong consumer confidence and greater awareness regarding financial protection.","quote":"The growth in sum assured reflects strong consumer confidence and increasing awareness of financial protection.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Management noted that guaranteed return products continue to see very good domestic customer demand.","quote":"And we feel as a company that this is a product line which has a very good demand in the country for the assured benefit kind of a return.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The company actively reprices products based on movements in underlying yields.","quote":"And our yields, we keep a close eye and reprice our products as per the yield movement.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":17.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Expenses during the quarter were partly impacted by the labor code across SBI Life's employee base.","quote":"And secondly, also, if you see compare between the June '25 to June '26, the labor code impact to a certain extent because of the number of employees, and this is the first quarter where we have seen this impact.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"SBI Life achieved a 26.2% VNB margin, which would have been 27.4% without the GST impact.","quote":"We have sustained a healthy margin of 26.2% for the quarter ended 30th June 2026. Excluding GST impact, VoNB would have been INR14.7 billion, representing 35% growth with a VoNB margin of 27.4%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"SBI Life expanded its distribution network by opening 11 new branches and onboarding over 34,000 gross agents during the quarter.","quote":"During the quarter, the company added over 34,000 agents on a gross basis and 11 new branches.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"SBI Life established a new corporate agency partnership with J&K Bank, with business scheduled to commence during the quarter.","quote":"And during the quarter, we have entered into a new corporate agency tie-up with J&K Bank, and the business will be starting sometime in this quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":15.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The long-term outlook for the Indian life insurance industry is supported by favorable regulations, digital adoption, and solid economic fundamentals.","quote":"The long-term outlook for the Indian life insurance industry remains encouraging, supported by strong economic fundamentals, a favorable regulatory environment and increasing digital adoption.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Looking ahead, the company remains confident in the long-term growth potential of the life insurance sector in India and its ability to navigate the evolving landscape with a continued focus on profitable and sustainable growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[{"kpi":"Gross written premium (Rs cr)","value":212.9,"unit":"INR billion","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":4},{"kpi":"VNB margin %","value":26.2,"unit":"%","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SBILIFE_30072026185215_SE30072025_signed.pdf","page":4},{"kpi":"Solvency ratio (x)","value":1.96,"unit":"x","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.co